---
layout: base.njk
---
<article class="article wrap">
  <a class="back-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}">← All entries</a>
  <header class="article-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Entry {{ entryNumber }} <span>/</span> {{ category }}</p>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="article-summary">{{ description }}</p>
    <p class="byline">{{ site.author }} <span>·</span> <time datetime="{{ date | isoDate }}">{{ date | displayDate }}</time></p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">{{ content | safe }}</div>
  <aside class="article-note"><strong>About this diary</strong><p>AI assistance is part of the work. Entries record the decisions, evidence, and remaining uncertainty alongside the implementation.</p></aside>
  <a class="back-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}">← Back to the journal</a>
</article>
